Please email Mrs. Epps if you have any questions. eppsj@conwayschools.info

¡Hablemos de premios! 🏆 Nuestro Read-A-Thon está lleno de formas de celebrar a los lectores por sus logros de lectura y de recaudación. Desde premios para la clase entera hasta premios individuales, estamos listos para animar cada logro. 🎉 Pregunten a su lector favorito qué premio quiere alcanzar y ayúdenlo a lograrlo. 📚💰
@myreadathon #ReadRaise #MyReadathon

We couldn’t have done it without YOU! 🎉
Because of your reading and fundraising, our total donated amount was $15,595  and read 77,693 minutes together. We’re SO PROUD of what we accomplished for Julia Lee Moore Elementary Library program and so grateful for every reader, donor, and staff member who helped make it happen. 📚💙
@myreadathon #JuliaLeeMoore #ReadRaise #MyReadathon

Guess you'd say that Wednesday, April 8th was officially Conway Day at JLM! We started off with a "toadally" great visit from Croaker and Daisy and ended with our annual Crawl, Drag, and Squirt competition with the incredible Conway Fire Department. Thank you for making this day a great one for the kids at JLM. 

